Epictetus; translated by George Long.

[Retained EPUB](../books/epictetus-enchiridion.epub) · [Original book and publication notices](https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/10661). English. Project Gutenberg identifies this edition as public domain in the USA; its notices and production credits remain in the retained file.

Used passages: The Encheiridion, or Manual, sections 1, 5, 17, 20, and 30, followed by the complete Manual and selected Discourses. The book's contents separates the biographical note, Discourses, and Manual. [Reading guide](../schools/Epictetus.lingua#r_35EWPVCFYNWZ0DYG5R5HM05TC2).

